WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:15.168
are you?"

2
00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:16.248
Roxy cried.

3
00:00:17.108 --> 00:00:18.989
The Ghost Bandit was somewhere in the room.

4
00:00:20.429 --> 00:00:21.690
But Roxy didn't know where.

5
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:24.451
Suddenly she heard someone running.

6
00:00:25.711 --> 00:00:28.512
She spun around and saw a door quickly open and close.

7
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:31.560
"There he is!"

8
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.901
Roxy leaped from the stack of money.

9
00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:37.203
She burst through the door and into a long hallway.

10
00:00:38.503 --> 00:00:40.384
The villain's footsteps went around a corner.

11
00:00:41.664 --> 00:00:42.525
Roxy followed.

12
00:00:44.325 --> 00:00:46.706
As she turned the corner, she saw another door open.

13
00:00:48.827 --> 00:00:52.069
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

14
00:00:52.989 --> 00:00:54.970
Boom! The door exploded.

15
00:00:54.990 --> 00:01:00.092
"Ha-ha! You can't see me!"

16
00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:02.913
The Ghost Bandit laughed and kept running.

17
00:01:03.894 --> 00:01:05.434
Roxy stood still and listened.

18
00:01:05.454 --> 00:01:10.356
"I can hear his footsteps," she thought.

19
00:01:10.376 --> 00:01:13.238
"He's running down another hallway."

20
00:01:14.238 --> 00:01:16.139
Roxy followed, listening as she went.

21
00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.100
The footsteps led into another big room.

22
00:01:22.421 --> 00:01:24.742
This room had a huge machine along one wall.

23
00:01:25.663 --> 00:01:28.104
The machine had big rollers and a conveyor belt.

24
00:01:29.744 --> 00:01:30.825
Money covered the belt.

25
00:01:31.725 --> 00:01:33.226
Buckets of ink sat nearby.

26
00:01:33.246 --> 00:01:38.389
"This must be where workers print the money," thought Roxy.

27
00:01:41.071 --> 00:01:44.873
Crash! A garbage can suddenly hit the wall near Roxy.

28
00:01:44.893 --> 00:01:48.175
"Aargh!" cried the Ghost Bandit.

29
00:01:48.195 --> 00:01:51.837
"I missed!"

30
00:01:51.857 --> 00:01:55.179
Roxy watched as another garbage can seemed to float into the air.

31
00:01:56.159 --> 00:01:57.240
Then it shot toward her!

32
00:01:58.472 --> 00:02:00.673
Roxy ducked just before the garbage can hit her.

33
00:02:01.814 --> 00:02:03.335
It smashed against the big machine.

34
00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:07.437
Roxy flew as fast as she could and tried to grab the bandit.

35
00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:13.180
"Oh, you'll never catch me!"

36
00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.261
said the bandit.

37
00:02:15.321 --> 00:02:16.322
Then he was quiet.

38
00:02:17.602 --> 00:02:20.964
Using her super hearing, Roxy heard the villain's heartbeat nearby.

39
00:02:22.325 --> 00:02:25.347
She flew toward the sound and tried to grab the Ghost Bandit again.

40
00:02:26.547 --> 00:02:27.628
But again she missed.

41
00:02:28.384 --> 00:02:30.685
The Ghost Bandit laughed.

42
00:02:31.505 --> 00:02:34.006
Each time Roxy heard him, she flew to the sound.

43
00:02:35.687 --> 00:02:37.948
But every time, the Ghost Bandit moved away.

44
00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:41.590
"Grr!" Roxy stamped the floor.

45
00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.310
The walls shook.

46
00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.872
"I'm never going to stop this dumb villain if he's invisible!

47
00:02:47.892 --> 00:02:50.533
I'm getting really tired of—oof!"

48
00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:54.455
A box hit Roxy, knocking her over.

49
00:02:55.495 --> 00:02:57.256
She bumped into one of the buckets of ink.

50
00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.600
Some ink spilled on her boot.

51
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:02.161
Roxy looked at the ink.

52
00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:04.362
"Hmm," she thought.

53
00:03:04.382 --> 00:03:06.102
"I have an idea!"

54
00:03:07.043 --> 00:03:09.203
Roxy jumped to her feet and lifted up a bucket.

55
00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:12.404
She tossed the ink into the air.

56
00:03:13.744 --> 00:03:15.045
Then Whoosh!

57
00:03:15.705 --> 00:03:17.446
Roxy blew the ink across the room.

58
00:03:18.646 --> 00:03:20.226
The ink sprayed across the walls.

59
00:03:21.427 --> 00:03:22.827
It sprayed across the machine.

60
00:03:23.747 --> 00:03:25.688
And it sprayed across the Ghost Bandit!

61
00:03:27.476 --> 00:03:28.380
"Aha!" cried Roxy.

62
00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.348
"I can see you now!"
